at the Olympics that he likely may have won even facing a top-notch Gribble. The day before this race he had won the 200 freestyle in world record time. Morales was ahead at the wall in 24.76, ahead of his world record pace, and had ½-a-bodylength on Groß. But he gradually closed the gap and regained the lead 10 metres from the wall, outtouching Morales in 53.08, another world record, as Morales was also under the old standard, with 53.23. The final was fast, very fast, as every swimmer except eighth-place finisher " [:a {:href "/athletes/50350"} "Bengt Baron"] " (SWE), the 1980 Olympic champ in the 100 back, recorded a personal best and a national record."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "R1"] [:th {} "B Final"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "196"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/47812"} "Michael Groß"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/FRG"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/FRG.png"}] "FRG"]] [:td {} "54.02 (1 h6)"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "53.08 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "476"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/51497"} "Pablo Morales"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {} "53.78 (1 h7)"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "53.23 (2)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "12"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/45168"} "Glenn Buchanan"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/AUS"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazo